,"rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-25T21:56:14-07:00","id":1068177,"title":"","content":"He meet young women at a college scholarship interview and those he feed off of he mind wiped into thinking they donated blood, complete with &quot;I donated sticker&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-25T22:21:11-07:00","id":1068184,"title":"","content":"The idea I'm sitting on right now is a vampire running a modeling agency, giving their herd business opportunities and eternal ghouled beauty in exchange for blood.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-25T22:44:38-07:00","id":1068191,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1068162-how-do-upscale-vamps-feed?p=1068168#post1068168\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember Soloman Birch had a pet family and threatened to let the girls grandmother or great grandmother (I forget) die unless she &quot;consented&quot; to be fed on.</div> </div> </div> </div>They seemed to be an upscale family. Living in a large house you have rooms for a large 'family' to hang around that you can feed off of.<br /> <br /> It's not unheard of to have administrators and other influential people to make hospitals and mental institutions available for so-called 'upscale' people to take advantage of.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-26T04:15:41-07:00","id":1068236,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1068162-how-do-upscale-vamps-feed#post1068162\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How far a commute will a resources 4 or 5 vamp probaly have to make between their haven and feeding ground.<br /> <br /> to be fair I live in a studio apt, in a complex right next to my towns country club.<br /> <br /> but if you live in a gated community,or hotel youd have to be totally demented to feed there.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really. So long as you don't take more than 2-3 vitae from people you're set. In a gated community, they would effectively be your herd. You can attend the reading clubs, barbecues, high school booze parties thrown while the parents are out of town, and feed off the attendees. Offer yoga, pottery, painting classes etc. and engage in extramarital affairs. Set yourself up as a tutor to middle age or high school children and they come to you.<br /> Hotels are even better with the fact that most people don't actually live there and typically leave after a day or so and you can afford to shallow feed. In the spa or pool, the exercise room, the bar, the elevators, the stairwells. Or just plain let yourself into the room of whomever you want. And if the hotel staff caters to/turns a blind eye to prostitution and escort services, affairs, and drug use due to the entitlement mentality of the rich as they're apt to do, that means nobody asks a lot of questions. And you don't even have to have a creepy hotel with hidden floors and secret passages as per AHS Hotel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5466-tsusasi","name":"tsusasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5466_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-26T14:47:34-07:00","id":1068423,"title":"","content":"As nasty as it is it's entirely possible for a nice house in a gated community to hold slaves brought in from other countries that could be dominated or blood bound into submission. If any investigators stumbled upon the thing, they could be reassured by a tour inside the house by the obfuscated trapdoor to the slave cellar, or a particularly cruel ghoul or vampire could simply order the slaves to stay silent and not move, backing it up with obfuscate, while investigators just ignore them as other innocent house dwellers.<br /> <br /> If rich people in real life can prey off of other humans in wealthy neighborhoods and get away with it, it doesn't take a leap to imagine vampires being able to do the same.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-26T16:34:32-07:00","id":1068467,"title":"","content":"oh curious, if a vamp decides to tutor a young person, and after having a bad night with them not wanting to study, decides to use disciplines to ensure compliance, how could that taint things?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-26T17:04:57-07:00","id":1068480,"title":"","content":"That really depends on what's done. If Dominate is used to simply erase or alter their memory of the &quot;bad day&quot; and insert key details for studying, it would probably just get chalked up as a successful lesson. If Majesty is used they'd probably back burner the concerns of the day in favor of impressing their tutor. Nightmare might leave an intimidating impression but they probably won't say anything out of fear. The parents aren't likely to care if it nets positive results and chalk up complaints as their kid simply not wanting to apply themself.<br /> If the tutor is using Majesty too liberally around their students and other adults, there is going to be accusations that they're sleeping with their students and or one of the parents, which can bring another level of drama/conflict. <br /> Too much Nightmare may see prospective clients simply opting for someone else. <br /> Dominate can have mixed results depending on how it's applied. Maybe attracting more clients. <br /> All of them could attract annoying, stupid, lazy or troublesome kids or obsessive perfectionist parents.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5466-tsusasi","name":"tsusasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5466_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-26T17:27:15-07:00","id":1068489,"title":"","content":"Well Dominate has potential to accidentally fog, lose, or alter memories and therefore studied information.<br /> Majesty could mean that the victim learned more about how the vamps nose crinkles when frustrated than the actual material.<br /> Nightmare I suppose could just induce one to learn enough to spit out the correct words before getting out of that monsters presence and forgetting it all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11661-rathamus","name":"Rathamus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11661_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-26T17:46:00-07:00","id":1068494,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tsusasi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1068162-how-do-upscale-vamps-feed?p=1068480#post1068480\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That really depends on what's done. If Dominate is used to simply erase or alter their memory of the &quot;bad day&quot; and insert key details for studying, it would probably just get chalked up as a successful lesson. If Majesty is used they'd probably back burner the concerns of the day in favor of impressing their tutor. Nightmare might leave an intimidating impression but they probably won't say anything out of fear. The parents aren't likely to care if it nets positive results and chalk up complaints as their kid simply not wanting to apply themself.<br /> If the tutor is using Majesty too liberally around their students and other adults, there is going to be accusations that they're sleeping with their students and or one of the parents, which can bring another level of drama/conflict.<br /> Too much Nightmare may see prospective clients simply opting for someone else.<br /> Dominate can have mixed results depending on how it's applied. Maybe attracting more clients.<br /> All of them could attract annoying, stupid, lazy or troublesome kids or obsessive perfectionist parents.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Dominate 1 &quot;Attend your lesson&quot; seems pretty simple and clearcut?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-26T18:09:39-07:00","id":1068498,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1068162-how-do-upscale-vamps-feed?p=1068494#post1068494\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Dominate 1 &amp;quot;Attend your lesson&amp;quot; seems pretty simple and clearcut?</div> </div> </div> </div>Assuming they don't make the resist check, they'd attend their lesson. Without additional input though, they may not remember the details.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5466-tsusasi","name":"tsusasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5466_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-31T21:30:41-07:00","id":1071598,"title":"","content":"another issue, frenzy, perversely, the Brat might be safest if the kindred uses dominate to coerce him to obey.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","u